# 1. PROJECT CONTEXT

The 5TOT Đà Nẵng system has recently received important customer feedback.

The previously implemented School-to-City flow allowed or assumed application-level forwarding.

This must be changed.

**NEW APPROVED BUSINESS RULE:**

A School Review Unit completes its preliminary review, prepares one consolidated list of recommended Individual Student applications, attaches one official decision document, and forwards that entire list to City exactly once per award season.

For the University of Da Nang:

- Eight distinct member institutions.
- One shared School Review Unit.
- One shared School reviewer account.
- One consolidated selected list.
- One common official decision document.
- One successful School-to-City forwarding operation per season.

This phase implements the real backend capabilities needed to enforce these rules.

Do not create a frontend prototype as a substitute.

Do not create a second backend service.

